{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_31","type":"agent_message","text":"Implemented one-hot decode, masked register data, and balanced OR trees for both register-file read ports. x0 behavior, synchronous reset and writes, and write-first bypass are preserved in [reg_file.sv](/srv/hwebench/clones/gpt-6-luna_xhigh-v2-rep5/cores/bench/worktrees/hyp-20260930-001-r2s0/cores/bench/rtl/reg_file.sv). I also added a guarded package include to [core.sv](/srv/hwebench/clones/gpt-6-luna_xhigh-v2-rep5/cores/bench/worktrees/hyp-20260930-001-r2s0/cores/bench/rtl/core.sv) so the requested glob-based lint command sees its typedefs in time.\n\nLint passed; formal passed **53/53** checks; cosim passed for both ELFs with `NRET=1`. Gowin timing reported **49.492 MHz** for place option 0. The run also reported 1605 registers, so the read structure may carry a notable area cost.\n\nDetails are in [implementation_notes.md](/srv/hwebench/clones/gpt-6-luna_xhigh-v2-rep5/cores/bench/worktrees/hyp-20260930-001-r2s0/implementation_notes.md)."}}
