{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_48","type":"agent_message","text":"The timing review exposed one latency mismatch in my first handshake: I had added a separate result register before EX/MEM, which made multiply take two extra EX cycles. I’m removing that register so the partial products feed the second stage combinationally and EX/MEM captures the result on the next edge, adding the intended single extra execute cycle."}}
