emory masks, and all existing stall behavior.\nexpected_impact:\n  fitness_delta_pct: 7\n  confidence: medium\nchanges:\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Compute load/store effective addresses for all three possible forwarded rs1 values in parallel, then select the completed address late and route it to EX/MEM.\"\n\nYAML parsed: hyp-20260930-002-r5s1 structural 1\nSchema validation: passed\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
