"description\": \"Wire the execute busy interlock to hold younger fetch/decode work while allowing older pipeline entries to drain correctly.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/hazard_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Integrate the divide interlock with load-use, redirect, and memory backpressure control.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 20, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\":\n…[41093 of 44165 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:a9d9ab940ef0f5c6]…\nage.\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 139.28, \"delta_pct\": -8.45, \"vs_baseline\": 1049.17, \"fmax_mhz\": 73.295, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 5262343, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 4151, \"ff\": 1810, \"seeds\": [74.584, 73.295, 73.295], \"perturbations\": [[0, 74.584, 13], [1, 73.295, 14], [2, 73.295, 14]], \"lutram\": 0, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 4, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_ex/u_multiplier/pp_hl_31_s1\", \"to\": \"dmem_3_dmem_3_0_0_s\", \"slack_ns\": -8.408, \"arrival_ns\": 18.702, \"logic_cells\": 13, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_multiplier\", \"cpu/u_ex\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 13, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-01T00:54:18.779559Z\", \"slot\": 1, \"round_id\": 11, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-10-01 hyp-20261001-002-r11s1 (regression, -8.45%): Registering forwarded operands before arithmetic puts the immediately preceding instruction's result beyond the capture edge, so dependency interlocks add CoreMark cycles that can outweigh a shorter execute path.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
