t is ready.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Wire the execute busy interlock to hold younger fetch/decode work while allowing older pipeline entries to drain correctly.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/hazard_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Integrate the divide interlock with load-use, redirect, and memory backpressure control.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 20, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\":\n…[21353 of 24425 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:afa116296827704a]…\naseline\": 537.87, \"fmax_mhz\": 34.4, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4449669, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 4373, \"ff\": 1635, \"seeds\": [36.649, 34.4, 34.4], \"perturbations\": [[0, 36.649, 30], [1, 34.4, 30], [2, 34.4, 30]], \"lutram\": 0, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_id/reg_q.rs1_addr_0_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_if/pc_9_s1\", \"slack_ns\": -22.286, \"arrival_ns\": 32.58, \"logic_cells\": 51, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_fwd\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu\", \"cpu/u_if\", \"cpu/u_rf\", \"cpu/u_id\", \"cpu/u_if\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 30, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-30T21:57:01.632720Z\", \"slot\": 1, \"round_id\": 6, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-10-01 hyp-20260930-002-r6s1 (regression, -30.36%): Resolving branches in ID puts register-file/EX-MEM/MEM-WB bypassed operands through the comparator and target adder into the same-cycle fetch redirect, while dependency interlocks add bubbles, so this decode-to-PC cone can outweigh removing branch resolution from EX.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
